<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose">
  <p><code>caseActions</code> and <code>helpMenu</code> share one pattern. Each menu item is a <code>role="menuitem"</code> out of the tab order (<code>tabindex="-1"</code>); the component moves focus among them. A Copy citation item copies its <code>data-copy</code> and reports <code>data-done</code> as a toast, or "Copy failed" with a way out; the clipboard falls back to a hidden textarea where the Clipboard API is unavailable.</p>
</div>
{{ table(["Key", "On the button", "In the menu"], [
